### Prerequisites
### Run with: func start   (NOT dotnet run)
### Requires Azurite running for AzureWebJobsStorage (UseDevelopmentStorage=true)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071
@agentName = HostedAgent

### Single-turn: chat with the hosted agent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agents/{{agentName}}/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What is the largest city in France?"
}

### Single-turn: another question
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agents/{{agentName}}/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Explain quantum entanglement in one sentence."
}

### Multi-turn session: start a new conversation (pick any sessionId)
@sessionId = session-001

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agents/{{agentName}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "My name is Alice and I love hiking."
}

### Multi-turn session: follow-up in the same session (agent remembers Alice)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agents/{{agentName}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What do you remember about me?"
}
